---
title: "invest (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_pause: investor calls invest(amount, signature)
    q_check_pause --> q_error_paused: contract is paused
    q_error_paused --> [*]: revert Paused
    q_check_pause --> q_check_ended: contract not paused
    q_check_ended --> q_error_ended: hasEnded == true
    q_error_ended --> [*]: revert SaleHasEnded
    q_check_ended --> q_check_sig: hasEnded == false
    q_check_sig --> q_error_sig: signature verification fails
    q_error_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_check_sig --> q_check_amount: signature valid (authorized signer)
    q_check_amount --> q_error_amount: amount < minimumInvestAmount
    q_error_amount --> [*]: revert BelowMinimumInvest
    q_check_amount --> q_transfer: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_transfer --> q_update_position: transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount) in bidToken
    q_update_position --> q_update_total: position.investedCapital += amount
    q_update_total --> q_emit: totalCapitalInvested += amount
    q_emit --> [*]: emit Invested(investor, amount)

    note right of q_check_sig
        INV-001: Only investors with valid signatures from authorized signers can invest
        INV-002: Investment only allowed while hasEnded == false
        INV-003: Each investment must meet minimumInvestAmount threshold
        INV-004: totalCapitalInvested increases monotonically during application period
        INV-005: position.investedCapital tracks cumulative deposits per investor
    end note
